OL,3,GNEWSACalls for parent-child spaces in
OL,4,AStates car parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States says any decision over
OL,7,Fcreating parent-child spaces in public
OL,8,Fcar parks would be "evidence-led".
OL,10,FThere have been calls for widening
OL,11,Fparking spaces for parents to use - the
OL,12,Fonly designated spaces currently are in
OL,13,Fprivate car parks like supermarkets.
OL,15,FThe Committee for Environment and
OL,16,FInfrastructure (E&I) said it would
OL,17,Fconsider any proposed changes alongside
OL,18,F"accessibility, safety, cost,
OL,19,Fenforceability and site constraints".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
